<title>UK: Hamburg Hypo adds 500 mln marks to Oct 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Hamburg Hypo adds 500 mln marks to Oct 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 1.5 billion marks from 1.0 billion marks, joint lead managers Bayerische Hypothekenbank, Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, DG Bank and Dresdner Kleinwort Benson said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HYPOTHEKENBANK IN HAMBURG AG</p>
<p> AMT  **1.5 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.50	MATURITY    02.OCT.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE **98.53    PAY DATE    20.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.25	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES	**ORIGINAL 1.0 BLN MARK DEAL LAUNCHED 15.JAN.97 AT</p>
<p>		97.72</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 1	   LISTING    HAMBURG   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.05	SELL CONC  0.19	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 964</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
